gxde-ai-core for Debian
========================

This package builds a Node.js Single Executable Application (SEA). The
`dpkg-buildpackage` run executes `npm ci` and therefore needs access to the npm
registry, or a pre-populated npm cache. Node.js 20 or newer is required.

The standalone binary and its sidecars are installed under
`/usr/lib/gxde-ai-core` and exposed through `/usr/bin/gxde-ai-core` and
`/usr/bin/hachimi`.

The upstream test suite is not run during the package build. Use
`npm run test` in the source tree if you need to validate a build manually.
